id: chrome-buttons
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: The card's chrome by finger: reload (the page loads again), home (the home page loads), back (the long page is back), forward (the home page again), new card (a second card opens on the start page)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-device-build.md R4
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
chrome reload
wait load 30
chrome home
wait url duckduckgo 40
chrome back
wait url jihad-long-static 40
chrome forward
wait url duckduckgo 40
sample page 0,100,756,700
chrome newcard
wait differs 0,100,756,700 page 15
shoot new-card
